@startuml
title Stakeholder Ecosystem

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Primary User" as User
actor "Project Owner and Developer" as Owner
actor "Technical Reviewers and Recruiters" as Reviewers
rectangle "Gmail Provider" as Gmail
rectangle "Telegram Provider" as Telegram
rectangle "AI Service" as AI
rectangle "Future Providers" as Future
rectangle "OmniDesk AI" as System

User --> System : uses workspace
Owner --> System : owns and develops
Reviewers --> System : evaluate
System <--> Gmail : integration
System <--> Telegram : integration
System <--> AI : assistance
System ..> Future : future integration
@enduml